{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can dwarf only bury their heads in mining? No ! From the day they invented the Magic Dice, they had other options. For example, conquering the world .. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drag Dices to destroy enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reasonably utilize the functions of different types of dice to maximize their effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/drag.gif?t=1750935007\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade you Dices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuously collect and strengthen dice on the road of conquest, enhancing one's own combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/strength.gif?t=1750935007\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stop the Goblins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By chance, you may encounter escaping goblins. Don't let them escape, otherwise they will steal your gold coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/goblin.gif?t=1750935007\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various enemy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different enemies have their own characteristics and weaknesses, and different strategies should be adopted to deal with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481360/extras/mutiCha.gif?t=1750935007\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2481360?t=1750935007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2481360?t=